<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 4.07 to 5872.92. For the week, the Dow fell 15.54 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 0.28 to 366.27, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.03.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1291 to 1010.</p>
<p>Volume was 406,785,730, compared with 499,852,820 Thursday. For the week, volume was 2,144,965,730.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
